RuleSet: AmbSections
* section ^slicing.discriminator.type = #pattern
* section ^slicing.discriminator.path = "code"
* section ^slicing.rules = #open
* section contains docinfo 1..1 MS
* section[docinfo] ^short = "Сведения о документе"
* section[docinfo] ^comment = "У2-1; таблица 6, страницы 58–59. Наличие необязательной секции не делает её содержимое необязательным."
* section[docinfo].code 1..1 MS
* section[docinfo].code = $SectionTypes#DOCINFO
* section[docinfo].entry 3..* MS
* section[docinfo].entry ^type[0].targetProfile[0] = Canonical(AmbEntry1)
* section[docinfo].entry ^type[0].targetProfile[1] = Canonical(AmbEntry2)
* section[docinfo].entry ^type[0].targetProfile[2] = Canonical(AmbEntry3)
* section[docinfo].entry ^type[0].targetProfile[3] = Canonical(AmbEntry4)
* section[docinfo].entry ^type[0].targetProfile[4] = Canonical(AmbEntry5)
* section[docinfo].entry ^type[0].targetProfile[5] = Canonical(AmbEntry6)
* section[docinfo].entry ^type[0].targetProfile[6] = Canonical(AmbEntry7)
* section[docinfo] obeys amb-section-docinfo-entries
* section contains benefits 0..1 MS
* section[benefits] ^short = "Льготы"
* section[benefits] ^comment = "У2-2; таблица 6, страницы 58–59. Наличие необязательной секции не делает её содержимое необязательным."
* section[benefits].code 1..1 MS
* section[benefits].code = $SectionTypes#BENEFITS
* section[benefits].entry 1..* MS
* section[benefits].entry ^type[0].targetProfile[0] = Canonical(AmbEntry8)
* section[benefits] obeys amb-section-benefits-entries
* section contains complnts 0..1 MS
* section[complnts] ^short = "Жалобы"
* section[complnts] ^comment = "У2-3; таблица 6, страницы 58–59. Наличие необязательной секции не делает её содержимое необязательным."
* section[complnts].code 1..1 MS
* section[complnts].code = $SectionTypes#COMPLNTS
* section[complnts].entry 1..* MS
* section[complnts].entry ^type[0].targetProfile[0] = Canonical(AmbEntry9)
* section[complnts] obeys amb-section-complnts-entries
